              {
                "sub": true,
                "text": "2"
              },
              {
                "text": "H"
              },
              {
                "sub": true,
                "text": "3"
              },
              {
                "text": "O"
              },
              {
                "sub": true,
                "text": "2"
              },
              {
                "text": " titrated with 0.100 M NaOH) titration. The table below shows a more detailed sequence of changes in the pH of these same two titrations. The values of the pH measured after successive additions of small amounts of NaOH are listed in the first column, and are graphed in the images below, as a titration curve. "
